  "story": {
    "title": "Sita and her purple pencil",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Sita is a little girl. She likes writing. Whenever she writes, she feels so happy! She writes about the buzzing bees. She writes about the green trees. She writes about the banyan tree swing and about everything.",
      "One day Sita saw a beautiful blue bird on a big Guava tree. It had shiny blue feathers and a long brown beak. It was singing sweetly and Sita loved it. “I am going to write about this pretty blue bird,” said Sita. She looked inside her green bag to take out a small book and her favourite purple pencil. She looked and looked and looked , but the pencil wasn’t there.",
      "“Where did my purple pencil go?” thought Sita. She ran back to her cosy house to look for it. She looked on the carpeted floor. She looked on the wooden chair. She looked everywhere, but the long pencil wasn’t there.",
      "“What happened, dear? Why are you sad?” asked her loving mother, looking at the little girl. “I can’t find my purple pencil, Amma,” said Sita. “Oh, dear! I am so sorry. I took your favourite pencil in the morning. I forgot to put it back , but it is somewhere on the metal rack,” spoke Amma, sounding sorry. It must feel so bad to see your daughter worried.",
      "Amma came out with a purple pencil and Sita’s round eyes shone with a twinkle. She took the pencil from her mother’s hand and started dancing all around. Now Sita can write about everything again. She can write interesting stories. She can write lyrical poems. She can write a simple song and we can sing along."
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "Sita is a little girl.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sita là một cô bé nhỏ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She likes writing.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé thích viết lách."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Whenever she writes, she feels so happy!",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mỗi khi viết, cô bé cảm thấy rất vui!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She writes about the buzzing bees.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé viết về những chú ong vo ve."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She writes about the green trees.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé viết về những cái cây xanh."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She writes about the banyan tree swing and about everything.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé viết về cái xích đu cây đa và về mọi thứ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "One day Sita saw a beautiful blue bird on a big Guava tree.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Một ngày nọ, Sita thấy một chú chim xanh xinh đẹp trên cây ổi lớn."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It had shiny blue feathers and a long brown beak.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nó có bộ lông xanh óng ánh và cái mỏ nâu dài."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It was singing sweetly and Sita loved it.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nó hót líu lo và Sita rất yêu thích."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“I am going to write about this pretty blue bird,” said Sita.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "“Mình sẽ viết về chú chim xanh xinh xắn này,” Sita nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She looked inside her green bag to take out a small book and her favourite purple pencil.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé nhìn vào trong túi xanh để lấy một cuốn sách nhỏ và cây bút chì màu tím yêu thích của mình."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She looked and looked and looked , but the pencil wasn’t there.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé tìm mãi, tìm mãi, nhưng không thấy cây bút chì đâu cả."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“Where did my purple pencil go?” thought Sita.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "“Cây bút chì màu tím của mình đi đâu rồi nhỉ?” Sita nghĩ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She ran back to her cosy house to look for it.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé chạy về nhà ấm cúng của mình để tìm."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She looked on the carpeted floor.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé tìm trên sàn trải thảm."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She looked on the wooden chair.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé tìm trên ghế gỗ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She looked everywhere, but the long pencil wasn’t there.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé tìm khắp nơi, nhưng cây bút chì dài không có ở đó."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“What happened, dear?",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "“Có chuyện gì vậy con yêu?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Why are you sad?” asked her loving mother, looking at the little girl.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sao con buồn vậy?” mẹ yêu thương của cô bé hỏi, nhìn cô bé."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“I can’t find my purple pencil, Amma,” said Sita.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_019.mp3",
        "text_vi": "“Con không tìm thấy cây bút chì màu tím của con, Amma,” Sita nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“Oh, dear! I am so sorry.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_020.mp3",
        "text_vi": "“Ôi con yêu! Mẹ xin lỗi nhiều."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I took your favourite pencil in the morning.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_021.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ đã lấy cây bút chì yêu thích của con vào buổi sáng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I forgot to put it back , but it is somewhere on the metal rack,” spoke Amma, sounding sorry.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_022.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ quên không để lại chỗ cũ, nhưng nó ở đâu đó trên cái giá kim loại,” Amma nói, giọng hối lỗi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It must feel so bad to see your daughter worried.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_023.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chắc hẳn mẹ cảm thấy rất tệ khi thấy con gái mình lo lắng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Amma came out with a purple pencil and Sita’s round eyes shone with a twinkle.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_024.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Amma đi ra với cây bút chì màu tím và đôi mắt tròn của Sita sáng lên lấp lánh."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She took the pencil from her mother’s hand and started dancing all around.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_025.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé cầm lấy cây bút chì từ tay mẹ và bắt đầu nhảy múa khắp nơi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Now Sita can write about everything again.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_026.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bây giờ Sita lại có thể viết về mọi thứ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She can write interesting stories.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_027.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé có thể viết những câu chuyện thú vị."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She can write lyrical poems.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_028.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé có thể viết những bài thơ trữ tình."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She can write a simple song and we can sing along.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_13738/s_029.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé có thể viết một bài hát đơn giản và chúng ta có thể hát theo."
      }
    ]
  },
